Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:49:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Add Easy and Hard game levels with a type-the-word quiz

Hard level: the tile page shows only the definition and the player types
the word. Right answer gives a bonus, wrong answer a malus (texts in
content/game.json). Tolerant matching: case, accents, punctuation,
spacing, synonyms and small typos.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
